    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectDetected? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToTheObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF CanPickUpObject? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO PickUpObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tDO ScanForObjectAgain\n\t\t\tDO LookForAnotherObject\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
